  "document": "Conradin\nConrad (25 March 1252 – 29 October 1268), called \"the Younger\" or \"the Boy\", but usually known by the diminutive Conradin (German: \"Konradin\" , Italian: \"Corradino\" ), was the Duke of Swabia (1254–1268, as Conrad IV), King of Jerusalem (1254–1268, as Conrad III), and King of Sicily (1254–1258, \"de jure\" until 1268, as Conrad II)."
